  "facts_of_case": "The respondent/husband filed OP No.275 of 2014 for dissolution of marriage against his wife. The matter was posted for ex parte evidence and an ex parte decree was passed on 29.04.2014. The petitioner/wife then filed IA No.1525 of 2014 to condone the delay in filing an application to set aside the ex parte decree.",
